{
  "version": 1,
  "title": "Hybrid cloud landing zone with hub-and-spoke network",
  "description": "An enterprise connects two data centres and its offices to a multi-account cloud estate through a central network hub. Inspection, DNS and shared services sit in the hub, workloads live in separate accounts per environment, and identity, logging and policy are applied from a management account.",
